t from the measured 596.5 MB and give a second reading.\n\n**Status**\n- The steering note from the progress review was followed: this cycle's LabVIEW work was a real build step of the main deliverable. The open-questions list was checked and has none.\n- `docs/d1/ring-p4.md` reached 429 lines, over the 400-line limit, so it is frozen. P4 decisions now continue in `docs/d1/ring-p4b.md` (decisions 323–326).\n- **The runner stops after this cycle.** The 90 % weekly-usage stop was written into STATUS at 23:04. It restarts only when you say so.\n- When it restarts, cycle 142 builds P4 session 2 on top of the saved file. The details are in `tools/bench/next.json` and the NEXT section of STATUS.","ttft_ms":2177,"type":"result","duration_ms":6859670,"uuid":"940c266e-e6c4-437f-a8f1-8380800d385f","ttft_stream_ms":1873,"time_to_request_ms":216,"first_content_frame_ms":1874,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
